CREATED:20260831T175449Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Saturday\, November 21\, from 9:00-11:00 a.m. for t
 he official launch of the new Unearthing Duke Forest Trail near the Woode
 n Bridge in the Korstian Division.\n\nThrough three newly installed signs
 \, visitors can explore some of the rich and complex human history of the
  land that is today called the Duke Forest and learn about historic featu
 res that remain visible on the land today.\n\nThe event will feature rema
 rks from project leaders and contributors\, a guided opportunity to exper
 ience the trail\, and time to celebrate the many individuals and partners
  who helped bring this project to life.\n\nThis event is part of the We t
 he People initiative\, a Duke and Durham collaboration commemorating the 
 250th anniversary of the United States through public programs that explo
 re our shared history\, evolving identity\, and collective future.
DURATION:PT2H
DTSTAMP:20260831T175449Z
