 \n\nFeaturing students in individual performances\, these recitals offer 
 each musician the opportunity to share their artistry\, develop confidenc
 e onstage\, and bring a wide range of repertoire to life.\n\nAdditional p
 rogram details will be announced soon.\n\nThis event is free and open to 
 the public. All are welcome.
