CREATED:20260714T181432Z
DESCRIPTION:Experience the artistry and expressive range of the Calichi Tr
 io\, featuring Duke Music faculty members Ieva Jokubaviciute\, piano\; Hs
 iao-Mei Ku\, violin\; and Caroline Stinson\, cello.\n\nThe program pairs 
 Johann Nepomuk Hummel's graceful and spirited Piano Trio in E-flat Major\
 , Op. 12\, with Dmitri Shostakovich's powerful Piano Trio No. 2 in E Mino
 r\, Op. 67. Spanning contrasting musical worlds\, these works move from C
 lassical elegance and sparkling interplay to profound intensity\, emotion
 al depth\, and dramatic urgency.\n\nTogether\, the three musicians bring 
 this compelling repertoire to life through intimate musical conversation\
 , remarkable ensemble playing\, and the rich combination of piano\, violi
 n\, and cello.\n\nThis event is free and open to the public. All are welc
 ome.
DURATION:PT2H
DTSTAMP:20260715T172243Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261122T150000
LAST-MODIFIED:20260715T172243Z
