CREATED:20260909T163339Z
DESCRIPTION:In this weekly clinical conference\, fellows present cases fro
 m the inpatient consult services followed by a review of literature suppo
 rting key clinical questions raised in the case. This is a highly interac
 tive exercise in the diagnosis and management of clinical infectious dise
 ases and adds a wealth of case material to the repertoire of all the Divi
 sion members. This conference stresses the means of arriving at the corre
 ct diagnosis more than picking the right diagnosis itself.
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260910T130000
